  "description": "A high-performance include/exclude text filtering engine for .NET 8 and .NET 10. Glob (wildcard, character-class, brace-alternation) and regex patterns compile into a cost-tiered matcher that runs the cheapest strategies first, with Ant/MSBuild-style include/exclude set semantics or gitignore-style last-match-wins ordered rules, gitignore-convention list parsing, and built-in match telemetry with an optional per-decision observer.",
